WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:10.521
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and this week
on Arrow we got to watch Roy’s rocky quality

00:00:10.521 --> 00:00:12.670
training montage, minus the tube socks.

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:15.620
And we got a nice teaser for the suicide squad.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.927
Just like last week I’ll be doing a new
arrow q&amp;a video tomorrow so write any questions

00:00:16.927 --> 00:00:17.927
you want me to include in the comments.

00:00:17.927 --> 00:00:19.210
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:21.779
I’ll try to get it up by tomorrow night.

00:00:21.779 --> 00:00:24.660
We’ve got a lot to get through and I’m
trying to post this before I hit a hundred

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:29.130
thousand subscribers to let’s do our top
5 moments and then I’ll do my review.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.260
Number 5 - Sideways skinclaw wolverine reference.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:36.140
This is the DC universe, but did anyone else
get a wolverine vibe when that man started

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.590
digging Bronze tiger’s claws out of his
skin.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:42.280
We saw all the claws come out, but what about
the hinge he fastens them to?

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:44.270
I think that’s what he had hidden in his
legs.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:48.660
Without those, the blades are just sharp knives.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:51.340
Number 4 - All of the Malcolm Merlyn Shoutouts.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:55.400
For an episode that did not feature John Barrowman,
the characters mentioned Merlyn a lot.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.799
I kept expecting him to show up in the end
teaser.

00:00:57.799 --> 00:01:01.930
He’s got to come back sometime, so I’m
guessing next week’s League of Assassin’s

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:02.930
episode.

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:04.140
Bonus high fives for the Tommy shoutout.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:07.380
I’ve seen a lot of you ask if I think he’s
ever coming back, but all I have as evidence

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:11.570
of that is this behind the scenes picture
stephen amell posted to his facebook page.

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:14.080
So maybe they filmed a scene for this episode
and it just got cut during the edit.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:15.080
Number 3 - Drunk Laurel.

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.080
This is really that last scene.

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:18.370
But I knew her going off the deep end was
going to be what oliver used to bring black

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:19.370
canary back.

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:22.290
So when he made that phone call in the bar
I had a feeling it was to her.

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:26.500
She’s back in the next episode and nyssa
al ghul is coming to get her.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.060
It sounds like they had a relationship.

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:32.700
I wonder who’s the oliver and who’s the
felicity in that situation.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:35.530
Number 2 - It’s really more of a Squad.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:38.240
We finally got our first official suicide
squad shoutout.

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:41.950
The writers had been talking about it since
comic con but it took half a season to get

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:42.950
there.

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:45.860
I’m predicting that we’ll see them on
a mission for ARGUS before the season finale

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:46.860
this year.

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:48.320
And they’ll definitely be part of season
3.

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:50.990
I don’t think we’ll see harley quinn any
time soon though.

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:53.820
So don’t expect the exact same roster from
the comic books.

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:56.640
Number 1 - Do you have one of your hoodies?

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.509
Do you even have to ask.

00:01:58.509 --> 00:01:59.640
Best moment of the episode.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:03.829
A lot of you guys have asked me which version
of Roy I think he’s going to be on the show.

00:02:03.829 --> 00:02:05.549
It doesn’t look like they’re training
him to use arrows.

00:02:05.549 --> 00:02:09.650
So I don’t think that he’ll be the red
arrow, but I do think they’ll make a lot

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:10.690
of ‘red’ jokes.

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:14.760
And that hoodie will probably be his uniform
for the rest of the season.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:19.860
I predict that during the season finale in
the aftermath of whatever ends up happening

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:23.860
that Oliver will give him a real red leather
uniform like his green arrow costume.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:27.150
Honorable mention goes to Felicity’s Bronze
tiger joke at the beginning of the episode.

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:30.390
It wasn’t the best moment of the episode,
but it was the funniest.

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:32.610
What a stupid name, Tigers aren’t bronze.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:35.099
Let me know what your favorite moment was.

00:02:35.099 --> 00:02:40.220
Suicide Squad, Roy joining team arrow or the
island scenes.

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:42.620
Overall I give the episode a solid A minus.

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:46.299
If Oliver hadn’t revealed himself and brought
roy into team arrow I would have given it

00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:47.299
a B plus.

00:02:47.299 --> 00:02:49.870
I give extra points for aggressive pacing.

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:53.239
In case you missed them there was a tease
for slade’s son Joe.

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:55.239
That’s Jerico in the teen titan comics.

00:02:55.239 --> 00:02:59.349
He’s got his own super powers, so I’m
really interested to see if Jerico comes on

00:02:59.349 --> 00:03:00.410
the show next year.

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.819
I’m not expecting him to make an appearance
this year.

00:03:02.819 --> 00:03:06.230
That would be a really cool storyline for
Slade next year.

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:08.890
It would be like Tommy and Malcolm Merlyn
situation.

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:12.940
I’m glad the drunk laurel arc is going to
resolve itself quickly, I don’t know if

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:16.900
the subsequent redemption arc for her will
mean becoming the true black canary or if

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.700
she’ll just clean herself up.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:21.670
Right now I’m really digging Caity Lotz
as the canary, so I don’t want her to leave

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:23.360
the show just yet.

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:26.260
In case your listening arrow writers.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:29.989
The only other good reference I caught including
Milo Armitage the arms dealer.

00:03:29.989 --> 00:03:33.500
In the comic books he was the grandfather
of the Conor Hawke green arrow.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.760
Let me know if you saw any references that
I didn’t mention.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:39.010
But the big ones were red arrow, the suicide
squad and Jericho.

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:40.510
Remember to post your questions for my Q&amp;A,
I hope the Jerico name drop helps you develop

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:41.519
a few theories about future storylines.

00:03:41.519 --> 00:03:43.140
Be sure to subscribe to get that video.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:45.670
I’ll try to post it by tomorrow night.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:50.730
I’m just passing one hundred thousand subscribers
as I’m posting this video.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:54.829
So thank you so much for being awesome everyone.

00:03:54.829 --> 00:03:58.790
I made a special thank you video that I’ll
post on thursday though.

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:02.280
Right now click here for my Q&amp;A and click
here for last week’s arrow episode.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.540
Thanks so much again, see you guys tonight.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:05.540
High Fives!

